cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this repository, its code, or its reports, please cite
  as below (per-scheme BibTeX entries in CITATION.bib). Code is
  licensed MIT; reports and documentation CC BY 4.0.
title: 'Public-Data Key-Recovery Studies of Five NICCS First-Round Signature Candidates'
abstract: >-
  Independent cryptanalysis of five NICCS first-round lattice signature
  candidates: full public-data key recovery and forgery for BiT-128 and
  DARTS-128; an implementation-level transition-direction reversal with
  exact recovery of gamma and an algebraic endgame reduction for Shuttle;
  and quantified learning-attack barriers for CS-128 and COMPASS-SIG-128.
